      },
      "source": [
        "## 6. Baseline Model: Logistic Regression\n",
        "\n",
        "To establish an initial benchmark, we train a **logistic regression model**. Logistic regression is commonly used for binary classification problems and provides interpretable results that help identify which variables influence churn predictions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
