      "source": [
        "## 9. Logistic Regression With Engineered Features\n",
        "\n",
        "After creating new features, the next step is to retrain the logistic regression model using the expanded dataset. This allows us to compare the original baseline model against a model that includes additional churn-related signals.\n",
        "\n",
        "The purpose of this step is to determine whether feature engineering improves predictive performance while still using an interpretable baseline model."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "f65CW3oKn64a",
        "outputId": "2cf788e3-c920-485b-ff0f-78e922096ecd"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Feature engineered dataset shape: (7032, 35)\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# Prepare the feature engineered dataset for modeling\n",
        "\n",
        "# Separate target variable\n",
        "y_fe = df_fe[\"Churn\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Drop customerID if it exists because it is only an identifier\n",
        "X_fe = df_fe.drop(columns=[\"Churn\", \"customerID\"], errors=\"ignore\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# One-hot encode categorical variables\n",
        "X_fe_encoded = pd.get_dummies(X_fe, drop_first=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Confirm shape after encoding\n",
        "print(\"Feature engineered dataset shape:\", X_fe_encoded.shape)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3S5iXP1uoFrs"
      },
      "source": [
        "The categorical variables are converted into numeric dummy variables using one-hot encoding. This is necessary because logistic regression requires numerical input features.\n",
        "\n",
        "The target variable remains the churn column, while customer identifiers are removed because they do not provide predictive value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "9XxpPmg6oTUq",
        "outputId": "c67306b3-678d-4a9a-b3e7-93144b57b1ef"
