        "### Tuned Gradient Boosting Model Evaluation\n",
        "\n",
        "After identifying the best hyperparameters, the tuned Gradient Boosting model is evaluated on the test set. This allows us to compare the tuned model against the original Gradient Boosting model."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "p80fA6G00yPs"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Save the best tuned Gradient Boosting model\n",
        "\n",
        "best_gb_model = grid_search_gb.best_estimator_\n",
        "\n",
        "# Generate predictions using the tuned model\n",
        "y_pred_gb_tuned = best_gb_model.predict(X_test_fe)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Generate predicted churn probabilities using the tuned model\n",
        "y_prob_gb_tuned = best_gb_model.predict_proba(X_test_fe)[:, 1]"
      ]
    },
